      "writtenOn": "2023-08-16T17:42:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The rest of the changes to `cpu_blur` should be mostly equivalent to what was before except it\u0027s been written to use the LayerSpace bounds coordinates directly instead of assuming they were made relative to the image earlier.\n\nI also removed the \"off-by-1\" bounds corrections because now onFilterImage() handles the CPU vs GPU mismatch for small sigmas.",
